{
  "_about": "Status tags and rules. dot: damage over time, every application adds a STACK (no limit, each stack has its own timer, all stacks of one kind tick together every tickMs). control: bosses take it for half as long (statusDurationScale). Numbers here are defaults a skill/item spec can override. stacking: like dot it stacks (each stack own timer) but deals no damage (chill). instant: no lasting status (knockback). Stat debuffs (weaken, armorBreak, curse, blind, mark) refresh per source; different sources add up.",
